# What stays on this computer only. The reasons are on cloud.html.
# Anything named here never goes to GitHub or a cloud session.

# --- Secrets and personal addresses ---
# The Telegram token already lives outside this folder (~/.config/investor-os/). These lines catch a slip.
.env
.env.*
*.env
*.pem
*.key
id_rsa*
id_ed25519*
secrets*
credentials*
.mcp.json
.streamlit/secrets.toml
.claude/settings.local.json
CLAUDE.local.md
# Holds my personal email, the contact SEC asks for. settings.example.toml goes up instead.
sensors/edgar/settings.toml

# --- My real money ---
# Default is closed: a new file here stays local unless it is named below.
Portfolio/*
!Portfolio/README.md
!Portfolio/Paper portfolio.md
# My own action, size and reason on each decision. Sizes turn real the day I hold something.
Journal/decisions/*
!Journal/decisions/README.md

# --- Data I said stays on this computer (Yahoo, Moody's, S&P through Shiller, FRED) ---
# Every page in the root is rebuilt here from these. Only cloud.html goes up, because it holds no such data.
/*.html
!/cloud.html
sensors/*/cache/
sensors/*/downloads/
sensors/*/runs/
sensors/*/samples/

# --- This computer's own state ---
sensors/8k-watch/seen.json
sensors/daily/state.json
sensors/radar/state.json
.claude/guardrails/
.claude/worktrees/
.obsidian/

# --- Rebuilt anywhere ---
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.DS_Store
